# ::tok The two-day visit included a group tour of the World Heritage Site, Macau Historic District, Macau Motorcycle Museum, a guided tour of the Samba Bar, the Samba Bar Bar, an immersive digital experience exhibition, Macau Wine Bar, the Old Quarter of Macau, and several large resort hotels and facilities: Upper Portugal, The Karl Lagerfeld, the Imperial Palace, the American Lion and the Maccabi, Perth, Macau Londoners, Macau Galaxy, the new Artelli multi-dimensional art space and the supernatural space of the Macau Venetians, TeamLab.
